    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group bring to the market this detached four-bedroom residence set on a generous 0.42-acre site on the outskirts of the town of Hospital, offering an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in a convenient and well-connected location.\n\nBuilt in 1972 and extending to approximately 115 sq.m. (1,237 sq.ft.), the property provides comfortable accommodation with excellent potential for modernisation and personalisation. The property benefits from oil-fired central heating, uPVC double-glazed windows, an attached garage, and is surrounded by mature trees and shrubbery, creating a private and attractive setting. The expansive gardens further enhance its appeal.\n\nAccommodation comprises of front porch, hallway, kitchen/dining room, sitting room, living room, 4 bedrooms, main bathroom and back porch.\n\nLocated just outside the vibrant town of Hospital, Co. Limerick, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of local amenities including Hospital National School, St. John the Baptist Secondary School, supermarkets, restaurants and cafs, pharmacy, church, service station, local shops, and everyday conveniences.\n\nA regular bus service operates between Limerick City and Mitchelstown, making commuting simple and convenient.\n\nThis property combines generous living accommodation, a substantial site and an excellent location close to all essential amenities. Whether you`re searching for a family home, a renovation project, or a property with room to grow, this residence presents an exciting opportunity.\n\nFolio Number: LK34768F\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the selling agent, REA Dooley Group.\n\n\nFront Porch - 16'5 (5m) x 5'3 (1.6m)\nLarge porch with tiled floor\n\nHallway - 12'6 (3.81m) x 4'11 (1.5m)\n1m x 6.4m \n\nKitchen/Dining Area\nFitted kitchen with tiled floor, timber floor in dining area\n\nSitting Room - 12'11 (3.94m) x 13'6 (4.11m)\nBright and spacious room with open fire\n\nLiving Room - 14'5 (4.39m) x 12'11 (3.94m)\nFeature fireplace with timber surround and inset solid fuel stove\n\nBedroom 1 - 9'10 (3m) x 8'10 (2.69m)\nTimber floor and built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 8'8 (2.64m) x 5'11 (1.8m)\nWC, WHB, Bath, Fully tiled\n\nBedroom 2 - 12'9 (3.89m) x 9'6 (2.9m)\nTimber floor and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 9'6 (2.9m) x 7'7 (2.31m)\nTimber floor and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - 10'6 (3.2m) x 13'6 (4.11m)\nTimber floor and built in wardrobes\n\nBack Porch - 3'3 (0.99m) x 8'3 (2.51m)\nTiled Floor\n\nAttached Garage - 17'5 (5.31m) x 10'4 (3.15m)\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
